<ns0:note style="-uslm-lc:I74" topic="amendments" id="id99103592-86b3-11f1-9949-c831ab2bbedc"><ns0:heading class="centered smallCaps">Amendments</ns0:heading><ns0:p style="-uslm-lc:I21" class="indent0">1972—<ns0:ref href="/us/pl/92/318">Pub. L. 92–318</ns0:ref> inserted “sex” after “religion,”.</ns0:p>
